l017","ordinal":278829,"en":"Don't let the fire go out!"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1197:b004:l018","ordinal":278830,"en":"That my blood is dead,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1197:b004:l019","ordinal":278831,"en":"Aged Bakay is mortal."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1197:b004:l020","ordinal":278832,"en":"Don't let trouble hit you,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1197:b004:l021","ordinal":278833,"en":"Ignorance, Bakay man"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1197:b004:l022","ordinal":278834,"en":"Don't pull out your white beard,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1197:b004:l023","ordinal":278835,"en":"Saying that Er Semetei is dead,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1197:b004:l024","ordinal":278836,"en":"Tell the wise old man,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1197:b004:l025","ordinal":278837,"en":"Tell everyone in Kyrgyz."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1197:b004:l026","ordinal":278838,"en":"Yellow blood with goblet eyes"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1197:b004:l027","ordinal":278839,"en":"Destroying the yellow bald horse,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1197:b004:l028","ordinal":278840,"en":"Put yellow blood on the horse,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1197:b004:l029","ordinal":278841,"en":"I continued what was interrupted,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1197:b004:l030","ordinal":278842,"en":"I collected what was scattered."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1197:b004:l031","ordinal":278843,"en":"I finished the courtyard of the people,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1197:b004:l032","ordinal":278844,"en":"I made the blood of the sultan,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1197:b004:l033","ordinal":278845,"en":"It's yellow blood"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1197:b004:l034","ordinal":278846,"en":"After putting it,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1197:b004:l035","ordinal":278847,"en":"Makes blood dizzy,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1197:b004:l036","ordinal":278848,"en":"White deer chasing cows,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1197:b004:l037","ordinal":278849,"en":"Make the land rich,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1197:b004:l038","ordinal":278850,"en":"Blue deer chase cow,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1197:b004:l039"