-2013:p1198:b004:l006","ordinal":278896,"en":"Burning and burning"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1198:b004:l007","ordinal":278897,"en":"Don't let my soul die from humiliation,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1198:b004:l008","ordinal":278898,"en":"This is a slave who came to prey,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1198:b004:l009","ordinal":278899,"en":"Don't measure the whip!"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1198:b004:l010","ordinal":278900,"en":"Eren, my father, Sary kan"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1198:b004:l011","ordinal":278901,"en":"Let him not get used to trouble,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1198:b004:l012","ordinal":278902,"en":"All his property"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1198:b004:l013","ordinal":278903,"en":"Don't let the dogs catch you"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1198:b004:l014","ordinal":278904,"en":"Let them face each other,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1198:b004:l015","ordinal":278905,"en":"Aiza reached out and hit the ax,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1198:b004:l016","ordinal":278906,"en":"Let them fight."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1198:b004:l017","ordinal":278907,"en":"Let them shoot a lot,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1198:b004:l018","ordinal":278908,"en":"Let us be saved from the wicked"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1198:b004:l019","ordinal":278909,"en":"Let it be separated!"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1198:b004:l020","ordinal":278910,"en":"That's what he said"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1198:b004:l021","ordinal":278911,"en":"My grandmother Chiyirt -"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1198:b004:l022","ordinal":278912,"en":"Golden womb mother -"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1198:b004:l023","ordinal":278913,"en":"White grandmother Nurmekem."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1198:b004:l024","ordinal":278914,"en":"One of the sons is a cousin,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1198:b004:l025","ordinal":278915,"en":"It turned out to be a lion."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1198:b004:l026","ordinal":278916,"en":"One of the girls is a brother,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1198:b004:l027","ordinal":278917,"en":"Kardygach, cousin of the girl"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1198:b004:l028","ordinal":278918,"en":"Manas, a man born from a man."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1198:b004:l029","ordinal":278919,"en":"When my hero father died,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1198:b004:l030","ordinal":278920,"en":"When the people gathered and buried,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1198:b004:l031","ordinal":278921,"en":"The number scattered the world,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1198:b004:l032","ordinal":278922,"en":"My godmother is Kanikei"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1198:b004:l033","ordinal":278923,"en":"Let him know that he is dry,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1198:b004:l034","ordinal":278924,"en":"Burning the soul like a fly,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1198:b004:l035","ordinal":278925,"en":"Special for Aydaly"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1198:b004:l036","ordinal":278926,"en":"Riding my mother"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1198:b004:l037","ordinal":278927,"en":"He was an old man who had left Echen."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1198:b004:l038","ordinal":278928,"en":"Don't worry if you see it."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1198:b004:l039","ordinal":278929,"en":"If you look at it, your stomach is full,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1199:b003:l001","ordinal":278930,"en":"My aged mother Chyiyrdy—"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1199:b003:l002","ordinal":278931,"en":"I have no other homeland than her."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1199:b003:l003","ordinal":278932,"en":"Her blessing is renowned among the people—"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1199:b003:l004","ordinal":278933,"en":"She is the mother of my falcon-like father,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1199:b003:l005","ordinal":278934,"en":"That venerable Chyiyrdy;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1199:b003:l006","ordinal":278935,"en":"May she die without suffering disgrace!"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1199:b003:l007","ordinal":278936,"en":"Oh, saintly matriarch!"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1199:b003:l008","ordinal":278937,"en":"Damn you, treacherous world:"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1199:b003:l009","ordinal":278938,"en":"What is here today is gone tomorrow;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1199:b003:l010","ordinal":278939,"en":"One day you show your face,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1199:b003:l011","ordinal":278940,"en":"The next you show your back—"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1199:b003:l012","ordinal":278941,"en":"Such a vile thing is this world!"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1199:b003:l013","ordinal":278942,"en":"While I stood ready and strong,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1199:b003:l014","ordinal":278943,"en":"My valiant mother did not die."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1199:b003:l015","ordinal":278944,"en":"This soul of mine did not bury my mother."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1199:b003:l016","ordinal":278945,"en":"I performed no arduous funeral service;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1199:b003:l017","ordinal":278946,"en":"When Chyiyrdy died,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1199:b003:l018","ordinal":278947,"en":"I was not there to bury her myself."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1199:b003:l019","ordinal":278948,"en":"I did not have a spacious grave dug,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1199:b003:l020","ordinal":278949,"en":"Nor, inside that grave,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1199:b003:l021","ordinal":278950,"en":"Have a ruby lamp set;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1199:b003:l022","ordinal":278951,"en":"I did not have her washed with kumiss,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1199:b003:l023","ordinal":278952,"en":"Nor wrapped in cloth of gold;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1199:b003:l024","ordinal":278953,"en":"I did not slaughter six thousand head,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1199:b003:l025","ordinal":278954,"en":"Beginning with horses, in her honor,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1199:b003:l026","ordinal":278955,"en":"Nor hold a feast for all the people;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1199:b003:l027","ordinal":278956,"en":"I did not attend her funeral almsgiving,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1199:b003:l028","ordinal":278957,"en":"Nor, saying, “My valiant mother has died,”"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1199:b003:l029","ordinal":278958,"en":"Perform her rites myself;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1199:b003:l030","ordinal":278959,"en":"I did not stand at the head"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1199:b003:l031","ordinal":278960,"en":"Of my poor aged mother and watch over her."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1199:b003:l032","ordinal":278961,"en":"When I myself am dead,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1199:b003:l033","ordinal":278962,"en":"May they not call her a barren woman who devoured her child;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1199:b003:l034","ordinal":278963,"en":"May hers not be a dog’s death,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1199:b003:l035","ordinal":278964,"en":"May her grieving soul not be left forlorn,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1199:b003:l036","ordinal":278965,"en":"May they not drag her along the road"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1199:b003:l037","ordinal":278966,"en":"And let the Dungans tear her apart!"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1199:b003:l038","ordinal":278967,"en":"Crying, “My valiant son is dead,”"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1199:b003:l039","ordinal":278968,"en":"May Chyiyrdy, when her own death comes,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1199:b004:l001","ordinal":278969,"en":"Not claw both cheeks,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1199:b004:l002","ordinal":278970,"en":"Swallowing blood, unable to recover herself,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1199:b004:l003","ordinal":278971,"en":"Nor suffer grief like this."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1199:b004:l004","ordinal":278972,"en":"May my valiant mother Chyiyrdy"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1199:b004:l005","ordinal":278973,"en":"Never meet with such affliction."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1199:b004:l006","ordinal":278974,"en":"“She fed him rich rump meat and fat,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1199:b004:l007","ordinal":278975,"en":"Yet her precious son has died,” they will say;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1199:b004:l008","ordinal":278976,"en":"“Her cherished son has gone"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1199:b004:l009","ordinal":278977,"en":"To the true abode whence none return,” they will say;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1199:b004:l010","ordinal":278978,"en":"“His allotted days are spent,” they will say;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1199:b004:l011","ordinal":278979,"en":"“Her loving son has departed,” they will say."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1199:b004:l012","ordinal":278980,"en":"When her own hour of death comes,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1199:b004:l013","ordinal":278981,"en":"May she suffer no humiliation;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1199:b004:l014","ordinal":278982,"en":"May my valiant mother Chyiyrdy"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1199:b004:l015","ordinal":278983,"en":"Endure only the grave’s brief trial,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1199:b004:l016","ordinal":278984,"en":"For the grave is better than this life—"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1199:b004:l017","ordinal":278985,"en":"Let her endure only the earth’s brief trial!"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1199:b004:l018","ordinal":278986,"en":"May sorrow not impoverish her soul;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1199:b004:l019","ordinal":278987,"en":"May the blessed old woman not linger behind."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1199:b004:l020","ordinal":278988,"en":"May grief not impoverish her spirit;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1199:b004:l021","ordinal":278989,"en":"May my poor mother not remain behind!"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1199:b004:l022","ordinal":278990,"en":"And my own dear mother Kanykey—"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1199:b004:l023","ordinal":278991,"en":"May she not turn her thoughts toward death;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1199:b004:l024","ordinal":278992,"en":"Is he not her own descendant?"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1199:b004:l025","ordinal":278993,"en":"Let her take comfort in the child"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1199:b004:l026","ordinal":278994,"en":"Who remains after me!”"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1199:b004:l027","ordinal":278995,"en":"He murmured and rumbled,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1199:b004:l028","ordinal":278996,"en":"And before the noble hero finished his last wishes,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1199:b004:l029","ordinal":278997,"en":"Kanchoro, son of Chubak—"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1199:b004:l030","ordinal":278998,"en":"Alas, that troublemaking Choro—"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1199:b004:l031","ordinal":278999,"en":"Appeared ahead with a multitude."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1199:b004:l032","ordinal":279000,"en":"Damn you, Kanchoro—"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1199:b004:l033","ordinal":279001,"en":"God surely exists, you traitor to your salt!"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1199:b004:l034","ordinal":279002,"en":"The earth churned beneath the teeming host;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1199:b004:l035","ordinal":279003,"en":"He drove an army too vast for the land,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1199:b004:l036","ordinal":279004,"en":"Driving all the troops together."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1199:b004:l037","ordinal":279005,"en":"On the crest of a forked ridge,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1199:b004:l038","ordinal":279006,"en":"Toward your prince standing gaunt,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1199:b004:l039","ordinal":279007,"en":"Stripped of his steed,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1200:b003:l001","ordinal":279008,"en":"Toward your prince standing there exposed,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1200:b003:l002","ordinal":279009,"en":"They loosed their bows like pouring rain"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1200:b003:l003","ordinal":279010,"en":"And shot their arrows like hail."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1200:b003:l004","ordinal":279011,"en":"With vigilant Kanchoro at their head,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1200:b003:l005","ordinal":279012,"en":"They had chosen the path of treachery"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1200:b003:l006","ordinal":279013,"en":"And wrought a strange spectacle."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1200:b003:l007","ordinal":279014,"en":"The great host of the Black Jediger,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1200:b003:l008","ordinal":279015,"en":"Led by Kyyaz and Kanchoro,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1200:b003:l009","ordinal":279016,"en":"Crossed the low, tawny foothill plain,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1200:b003:l010","ordinal":279017,"en":"Advancing until they arrived."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1200:b003:l011","ordinal":279018,"en":"When the vast army in its tens of thousands"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1200:b003:l012","ordinal":279019,"en":"Surged over the land and arrived,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1200:b003:l013","ordinal":279020,"en":"The lone hero paced slowly, conserving his strength,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1200:b003:l014","ordinal":279021,"en":"And reverence came over him;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1200:b003:l015","ordinal":279022,"en":"The solitary gray-maned lion,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1200:b003:l016","ordinal":279023,"en":"Leaning upon Akkelte,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1200:b003:l017","ordinal":279024,"en":"Showed the mettle of a wolf"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1200:b003:l018","ordinal":279025,"en":"As he climbed untroubled"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1200:b003:l019","ordinal":279026,"en":"Onto a saddle-backed ridge."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1200:b003:l020","ordinal":279027,"en":"He cared no more that the Jediger might engulf him"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1200:b003:l021","ordinal":279028,"en":"Than if they touched the hem of his robe."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1200:b003:l022","ordinal":279029,"en":"Courage and defiant pride"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1200:b003:l023","ordinal":279030,"en":"Had been fashioned by my Lord,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1200:b003:l024","ordinal":279031,"en":"Who had granted them without measure."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1200:b003:l025","ordinal":279032,"en":"At the sight of the khan, the Jediger host"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1200:b003:l026","ordinal":279033,"en":"Burned inwardly with raging flame."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1200:b003:l027","ordinal":279034,"en":"Deeply distressed, they raised an uproar,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1200:b003:l028","ordinal":279035,"en":"Unable either to advance across the ridge"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1200:b003:l029","ordinal":279036,"en":"Toward Kyyaz and Kanchoro,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1200:b003:l030","ordinal":279037,"en":"For fear had seized the multitude,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1200:b003:l031","ordinal":279038,"en":"Or to turn back and flee;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1200:b003:l032","ordinal":279039,"en":"Nor could they lower their spears with a battle cry"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1200:b003:l033","ordinal":279040,"en":"And overwhelm the lionhearted hero."}]
